{"runId":"repair-denied-final-2026-09-06","accountLabel":"F1 Finance Officer","groupId":"D19","area":"Dashboard","step":3,"question":"那只解释任务总览和注意事项有什么区别，不用读取我的数据。","conversationId":"conv_b1c457b2b2094f50b09f","accepted":true,"duplicate":false,"timedOut":false,"maxSeq":30,"durationMs":16012,"skillId":"admin_portal_reader","category":"portal_reader","reader":{"result":"not_confirmed","page":"","section":"","sourceSection":"","selectedState":"","scope":"unknown","workflowState":"","answerShape":"unspecified","completeness":"unknown","facts":[],"missing":["portal_read_required"]},"plan":{"facts":[],"missing":[]},"actionEvidence":[],"answer":"在不访问您数据的前提下，我可以为您说明两者的一般区别：\n\n- **任务总览**：通常是对待办事项的汇总展示，例如当前有哪些任务、数量、类型和处理状态等。它帮助您快速了解整体工作量。\n- **注意事项**：通常是针对操作或流程给出的提醒，例如某些步骤需要特别确认、某些数据需要核对等。它关注的是“需要注意什么”。\n\n简单来说，任务总览是“有什么、有多少”的汇总；注意事项是“做的时候要留意什么”的提示。具体叫法和内容组织会因系统设计而有所不同。","terminalEvent":"turn.completed","eventTypes":["user.message","turn.started","assistant.status","skill.route","reader.result","assistant.message","turn.completed"],"auditEvidence":[{"recordType":"reader.evidence","category":"dsh","payload":{"facts":[],"missing":[],"stage":"planning_required_portal","rootCause":"portal_read_required","qualityTrace":[{"stage":"question_context","status":"passed","failureCode":"","durationMs":"0"},{"stage":"identity_permissions","status":"passed","failureCode":"","durationMs":"318.1"},{"stage":"knowledge_retrieval","status":"passed","failureCode":"","durationMs":"686.7"},{"stage":"planning","status":"passed","failureCode":"","durationMs":"1920.8"},{"stage":"planning","status":"passed","failureCode":"","durationMs":"2607.6"},{"stage":"result_classification","status":"failed","failureCode":"portal_read_required","durationMs":"0"}],"permission":{"fingerprint":"d41b7f639223ec9b2b206416bb1b469f58be3172839b7e7f4df8ba8b0521ee6d","roles":["Finance Officer"],"departments":["5"]},"knowledge":{"ok":true,"code":"ok","sources":["Dashboard-Admin-User-Manual-v3.md","Licensing-Admin-User-Manual